agreements and conditions required by this Subscription Agreement to be performed, satisfied or complied with by the Company at or prior to the Closing; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
