<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Lock-Up</FONT> Agreement substantially in the form attached as Exhibit A
to the Business Combination Agreement (the &#147;<U><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Lock-Up</FONT> Agreement</U>&#148;) which is to be entered into by certain parties pursuant to the Business Combination Agreement and the amended and restated
sponsor support agreement, dated as of [&#149;], by and among First Light Acquisition Group, LLC, a Delaware series limited liability company, the persons set forth on Exhibit B thereto, the Company and Calidi, providing for the restriction of the
transfer of shares of Common Stock by certain parties specified therein will be in effect as of the Closing Date; and </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
