Company or any of their respective affiliates (the &#147;<U>Transaction Parties</U>&#148;) for investment advice or as the Plan&#146;s fiduciary with respect to its decision to acquire and hold
the Subscribed Shares, and none of the Transaction Parties shall at any time be relied upon as the Plan&#146;s fiduciary with respect to any decision to acquire, continue to hold or transfer the Subscribed Shares and (ii)&nbsp;the acquisition and
