<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(r) Subscriber has or has commitments to have and, when required to deliver payment pursuant to <U>Section&nbsp;2</U>, Subscriber will have
sufficient funds to pay the Purchase Price pursuant to <U>Section&nbsp;2</U>. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(s) Subscriber acknowledges that it is not relying upon,
