purchase of the Subscribed Shares. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(t) No broker or finder is entitled to any brokerage or finder&#146;s fee or commission to be paid by
Subscriber solely in connection with the sale of the Subscribed Shares to Subscriber. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(u) At all times on or prior to the Closing Date,
